WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.400
Ryu falls after the light-Bushin prerequisite.

2
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.000
Crouching light punch intentionally whiffs during the knockdown.

3
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.400
The backdash makes Ryu’s throw attempt miss.

4
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.950
Standing heavy punch punishes the throw whiff.

5
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:04.950
